An abnormal and extremely agressive beetle has been sighted south of the Mouscarpone Plains, at the marsh's border. A reward of 3000 pieces of cheese is  offered to whoever manages to calm it down._P_Due to the dangerousness of the situation, we're calling for caution. Only shamans and mice blessed by Elisah are allowed to enter the area.

